{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_0_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Dark Horde, time is your most valuable resource. Every action you take costs Time Units (TUs), forcing you to think ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_1_3.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've spent your TUs, you must wait for your turn to resume. You can only play cards or abilities when Time is paused, so think strategically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_1_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon powerful minions and cast devastating spells from your dark spellbook. Experiment with synergies between your cards to unleash devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_2_2.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether commanding demons or invoking Death itself, build an army to overwhelm your enemies and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_2_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective is clear: either plunder the enemy Village or survive for 3 days against waves of angry Villagers. Every round starts with 180 Time Units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_3_2.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend them wisely to play cards or actions, then wait for your next turn. Seize gold, harvest souls, and destroy the enemy settlement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_3_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every victory, earn loot to enhance your deck. Upgrade cards, abilities, and unlock new, powerful skills to strengthen your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_4_3.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make will shape your path\u2014plan carefully, upgrade strategically, and prepare for increasingly challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/KeyArt_ShortLoop_crop.gif?t=1744355200\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features of The Dark Horde:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Starter Decks</strong> \u2013 Experiment with 20 unique decks, each offering different strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Face limitless challenges for continuous fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock stronger starting options as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Rewards</strong> \u2013 Upgrade a card after each victorious run. Forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>200+ Cards</strong>  \u2013 Expand your deck from over 200 unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of Synergies</strong> \u2013 Discover powerful combos for devastating strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 Every run offers fresh challenges and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Enjoy an immersive soundtrack by Alexander Nakarada.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Supply of Goblin Looters</strong> \u2013 Send goblins to their doom without a second thought... They make funny noises when they die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/TDH_Wishlist_CtA.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ding!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/b8ac93563f7ee853353c23537b01418184f79de8.jpg"},{"name":"Unlimited power!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/eea9b7af965988d4dc78bce6863547f7081e02db.jpg"},{"name":"A prize well deserved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/e4e56d6416d4a5c35e01b56acc01b7743ba2902a.jpg"},{"name":"Where can I put these?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/e56393e490d27b3ce5cec42e54ce50741fc5977c.jpg"},{"name":"Too many bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/eaa579671030ed049badaec9beee7c6a72c18117.jpg"},{"name":"Your precious...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/4422fc9902d7416fd327f15aa4174e65e5adba2c.jpg"},{"name":"Game Over?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/70205d03569cabed1b64c94d361a1a68cca39911.jpg"},{"name":"How about that?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/f0b2f5a26a039ded8800b433cedcec9575d9f1cc.jpg"},{"name":"You are so evil!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/d4da83a48fb7b5d43109fa4842b3cfc593052747.jpg"},{"name":"Zen Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2682860/3964f1b39a0b43e28456252255b65bc8c2a0c937.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2682860?t=1744355200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744355200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744355200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744355200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2686160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_0_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Dark Horde, time is your most valuable resource. Every action you take costs Time Units (TUs), forcing you to think ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_1_3.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've spent your TUs, you must wait for your turn to resume. You can only play cards or abilities when Time is paused, so think strategically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_1_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon powerful minions and cast devastating spells from your dark spellbook. Experiment with synergies between your cards to unleash devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_2_2.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether commanding demons or invoking Death itself, build an army to overwhelm your enemies and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_2_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective is clear: either plunder the enemy Village or survive for 3 days against waves of angry Villagers. Every round starts with 180 Time Units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_3_2.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend them wisely to play cards or actions, then wait for your next turn. Seize gold, harvest souls, and destroy the enemy settlement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/SteamTextBanner_Diorama_3_withText.png?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every victory, earn loot to enhance your deck. Upgrade cards, abilities, and unlock new, powerful skills to strengthen your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/GIF_4_3.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make will shape your path\u2014plan carefully, upgrade strategically, and prepare for increasingly challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/KeyArt_ShortLoop_crop.gif?t=1744355200\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features of The Dark Horde:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Starter Decks</strong> \u2013 Experiment with 20 unique decks, each offering different strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Face limitless challenges for continuous fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock stronger starting options as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Rewards</strong> \u2013 Upgrade a card after each victorious run. Forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>200+ Cards</strong>  \u2013 Expand your deck from over 200 unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of Synergies</strong> \u2013 Discover powerful combos for devastating strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 Every run offers fresh challenges and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Enjoy an immersive soundtrack by Alexander Nakarada.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Supply of Goblin Looters</strong> \u2013 Send goblins to their doom without a second thought... They make funny noises when they die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/TDH_Wishlist_CtA.gif?t=1744355200\" /></p>","developers":["Matt Storm"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strateg