MB), Radeon X1300 Pro (256 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":699,"final_formatted":"$6.99 USD","initial":699,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Matt Storm"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"9 Sep, 2024"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSo as many of you may know, I am a bit obsessed with games. This obsession causes me to try many, many different games and I thought I might start pointing out the overlooked gems I find. Case in point: The Dark Horde. It's a unique deck builder that mixes a bunch of genres and uses time as it's main currency.\u201d<br>Jesper Myrfors - One of the Authors of Magic: The Gathering<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_61a6ed4430e7e1ec9e00cac0cdf6692cd07165e5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_61a6ed4430e7e1ec9e00cac0cdf6692cd07165e5.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_47af1a93ed0073e8f90ff3308fd20b060ea06fe9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_47af1a93ed0073e8f90ff3308fd20b060ea06fe9.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_ef53e533457b9b50430c2270d605354842c66314.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_ef53e533457b9b50430c2270d605354842c66314.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_606e5eca11d5bbe44dd185baa69f816110deb564.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_606e5eca11d5bbe44dd185baa69f816110deb564.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_5830c00a1330ef704939bbda528555cfb25381df.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_5830c00a1330ef704939bbda528555cfb25381df.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_cc50e55bd6b4a95a9a6a5178de0b712df8412487.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_cc50e55bd6b4a95a9a6a5178de0b712df8412487.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_eeaafe95fe086cd82f903da034cde9b2ba7cdf66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_eeaafe95fe086cd82f903da034cde9b2ba7cdf66.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_35827a0c18775294cc1885cae4a004ba380ff5c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_35827a0c18775294cc1885cae4a004ba380ff5c2.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_25764ce45363087c774bc4e76290ceeb797c163f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744355200","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/ss_25764ce45363087c774bc4e76290ceeb797c163f.600x338.jpg?t=1744355200"}],"short_description":"In The Dark Horde, you control the battlefield with a deck of cards. Summon hordes of minions, cast devastating spells, and tap into the forbidden power of the Four Domains: Death, Destruction, Corruption, and Frost. It\u2019s not just what you\u2019ll conquer, but how you\u2019ll become the most feared Dark Mage!","steam_appid":2682860,"support_info":{"email":"mattstormsolodev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}